{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39583","headline":"甲子岁衔命到家至榕城册封次日闽王降旌旗於新丰市堤饯别 · 翁承赞","name":"甲子岁衔命到家至榕城册封次日闽王降旌旗於新丰市堤饯别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登庸楼上方停乐，新市堤边又举杯。\n正是离情伤远别，忽闻台旨许重来。\n此时暂与交亲好，今日还将简册回。\n争得长房犹在世，缩教地近钓鱼台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}